slide('verdict','The central finding',heading('The readout','Keep the personality.<br><span class="serif">Build the next full version.</span>')+'''<div class="verdict-grid mt"><article class="verdict keep"><span class="badge">Keep</span><h3>A complete record.<br>A distinct voice.</h3><p>Every album track has a full-song upload. Music videos, lyrics and candid Shorts give Blondshell several ways to show up.</p></article><article class="verdict"><span class="badge">Build</span><h3>Give a song<br>another moment.</h3><p>53 days after release, no further full-song album version is identified on the channel. The follow-through is entirely Shorts.</p></article><article class="verdict change"><span class="badge">Prioritise</span><h3>Use the session<br>already being teased.</h3><p>Heart Has To Work and Stone Fruit appear in Sirius XMU Shorts. Check full-take availability and rights before commissioning a new shoot.</p></article></div>'''+note('11 full-song album uploads; 24 Shorts after release day. Session Shorts establish that excerpts exist, not that full recordings are available.','API → INFERENCE'))
slide('channel','The channel today',heading('Channel health · captured 17 November','Active in Shorts.<br><span class="serif">Quiet in full songs.</span>')+f'''<div class="channel-stats mt"><div><b>{fmt(D['channel']['subscribers'])}</b><span>public subscribers · rounded</span></div><div><b>{fmt(D['channel']['lifetimeViews'])}</b><span>channel lifetime views</span></div><div><b>14 / 14</b><span>last-30-day uploads are Shorts</span></div></div><div class="grid2 mt"><div><p class="scene-read"><b>Last upload: 7 November.</b><br>Last full-song upload: 25 September.</p><p class="takeaway">The channel is still publishing. The gap is a fresh full-length destination for the album.</p></div><div class="watcher-note"><span class="badge">Watcher · limited history</span><h3>22 observations.<br>No release-week baseline.</h3><p>27 Oct → 17 Nov: the stored channel counter moves by +184,209 views. It repeats unchanged from 9–17 Nov, matching the API capture.</p><p>Show this as recorded movement; a current daily or weekly growth rate is not established.</p></div></div>'''+note('30-day window: 19 Oct–17 Nov inclusive. Watcher mapping matches channel UCJ1FMy0FK0aSeXosWvGXShg. Repeated counters prevent a reliable momentum headline.','API + WATCHER'))
