slide('leaders','The main campaign assets',heading('Confirmed album videos · 396,051 lifetime views','The two music videos<br><span class="serif">hold most album-asset viewing.</span>')+'<div class="grid3 mt">'+photo('ytdwKm-dJyg','Violins · music video','145 days old at capture')+photo('7M9A_sVI4BI','Stone Fruit · music video','53 days old at capture')+photo('5qX3xsr5zlQ','Heart Has To Work So Hard','183 days old at capture')+'</div><div class="weekly-strip"><span><b>59.6%</b> of 11 album-video lifetime views sit on the two MVs</span><span><b>Fur Elise</b> lyric video · 33.9k</span></div><p class="scene-read">Stone Fruit still moved in the observed series: <b>+5,216 views</b>, 27 October → 17 November. It is a sensible first follow-up candidate.</p>'+note('Stone Fruit Watcher: 92,168 → 97,384, separate from the fresh API total of 97,490. This is a 21-day observed interval; it does not establish that Stone Fruit has the fastest current momentum. Asset ages differ.','API + WATCHER → INFERENCE'))
