slide('audience','Give the personality a purpose',heading('Audience texture · comments and Shorts','Let the songs explain her.<br><span class="serif">Let her explain the songs.</span>')+'<div class="grid2 mt"><div>'+photo('Eto2h_kGios','Violins explanation idk','29 Jun · existing artist explanation · 2.7k lifetime views',False)+'<p class="small mt">An existing format to refine: pair a candid explanation with the relevant full song.</p></div><div class="quotes"><blockquote>“really interested in the recurring imagery of obscured vision with this album wowowowow”<cite>Stone Fruit · sampled public comment · 30 likes</cite></blockquote><blockquote>“The way she invented sunglasses”<cite>Fur Elise · sampled public comment · 28 likes</cite></blockquote><p class="scene-read">Viewers notice both the world and the personality. Test song stories and performance moments alongside the playful posts.</p></div></div>'+note('271 relevance-ranked top-level comments across seven videos, max 40 each; sampled, not representative sentiment. Current-window Short median: 2,321 lifetime views. The largest Short (21,723) has an emoji title; its reach does not establish music conversion.','API → INFERENCE'))
